WEBVTT

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.970
Translator: Ladholyman
Timer/Typesetter: Maceart
Ending: Huzzah

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.970
Presented by Doremi-fansubs
www.doremi-fansubs.com
#doremi@irc.rizon.net

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.970
This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:51.320
My very best work, free from hesitation.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:56.230
I have written my will in regards to my property and tea wares in Sakai.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.470
My death poem is finished, too.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:09.260
All that's left is to die beautifully.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.930
Aren't You a Fan of Imperfection?

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:19.000
Notice - Rikyū Sōeki shall be put to death.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:30.300
Rikyū Sōeki shall commit seppuku for crimes committed as the head tea master.
His blasphemous action of placing his own sculpture on the steps of Daitoku Temple's Sanmon gate cannot be pardoned.
He has abused his position of power and engaged in manipulating the price of tea wares.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:34.100
February 28, 1591 - Kyoto - Sen no Rikyū's Residence

00:02:58.130 --> 00:02:58.840
It's hailing!

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:03.700
Gunmen, move inside!

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:08.080
Everyone else stays outside until Rikyū commits seppuku!

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:32.120
Note: Rikyū's Death Poem

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:17.960
A life of seventy years, strength spent to the very last.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:23.430
With this my jeweled sword, I kill both patriarchs and buddhas.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:32.120
I yet carry the long sword I had gained and now at this moment I hurl it to the heavens.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.900
Master Rikyū, it's time.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:41.130
Thank you for everything you've done, Hochiku.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.530
Your tea spoons are renowned.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:53.480
Well then.

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:01.910
Let me begin my final tea ceremony.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:05.200
We're following orders, but it still doesn't feel right.

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:06.730
I can't calm down.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:11.670
We're warriors, and here we are, killing a merchant?

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:15.140
But we have to be on our guard.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:18.230
We don't know if there will be people coming to save Rikyū.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:28.020
Is that Rikyū?

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.850
What's with that getup!?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.340
Go put on your white clothes immediately!

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.440
Listen!

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.520
A-Are you crazy!?

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:51.420
Someone! Rikyū is going crazy!

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:57.900
What's going on here!? Settle down...

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.120
Enough of this!

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:21.120
This is going to look bad for the Uesugi clan...

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:24.070
Stop him, even if you have to destroy his arms and legs!

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:33.940
What's going on?

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:58.770
You're the one who wanted to commit seppuku during your own tea ceremony.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:01.570
Just accept death already.

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:06.450
You're still a useless disciple, Iwai Bichu.

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:11.390
I have no idea how you got the job of watching over my death.

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:28.470
This is what my last tea ceremony will be about.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:44.000
Where's Lord Makita!? Where's the seppuku assistant, Makita Awaji no Kami!?

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:48.170
I'm sorry I'm late, Lord Iwai.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:53.750
I am here now.

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:21.130
Assistant: Furuta Oribe

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.780
I think you should put an end to your stubborness.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:28.380
If you rescind the seppuku orders,

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:32.340
Master will come here and bow his head to you!

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:36.900
Won't that solve things without creating much of a fuss?

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:43.640
I can't. I was attacked by assassins in my bedroom.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:49.950
If I don't kill Rikyū, then my life is in danger.

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:54.260
Sasuke, I have a request.

00:07:58.050 --> 00:08:00.340
Cut off Rikyū's head for me.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.340
Is this some kind of joke...?

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:11.580
Mitsunari suggested it.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:13.770
I told you before.

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:19.090
You're the only one who can become the next head tea master.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.240
Before I realized it,

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:25.840
you've gotten quite popular among the commanders.

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:30.150
Mitsunari's suggestion makes sense.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:38.910
Having a regular seppuku assistant is not enough.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:46.460
In order to appease the commanders regarding the brevity of his crimes,

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:54.960
I must have you, the person closest to him, be the assistant.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:09:01.630
I understand, but what if I refuse?

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:06.550
You don't want to rule over all of the aesthetes?

00:09:20.010 --> 00:09:24.350
If I say no, that would be a lie.

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:28.480
But I cannot kill my own Master!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.690
Please accept my refusal!

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:38.470
If you refuse, then you will never be a warrior again!

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:48.330
I can't... I can't do this... But my title...

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:53.680
I finally realized it.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:58.830
The difference between me and Lord Araki and Lord Urakusai.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:05.830
If I give up my title, then I have nothing left.
No properties and no wealth.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:11.730
My businesses... My Ten Works of Oribe... The Setoya, even...

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:15.550
If I lose my reputation as a daimyo for the Toyotomi clan,

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:18.270
then I will lose everything.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:24.280
If only I had a bit of self worth...

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:30.130
If only I had found something to put my two feet on...

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:35.020
Sasuke, if you agree to this,

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:40.290
then I will pardon Hosokawa, who was with you when you sent Rikyū off.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:50.570
Please. We all wish for him to meet his end.

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:57.710
Please become my only friend.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.800
What!? The sign on the Ichijō Modoribashi Bridge...

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:28.030
The named assistant is...

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.090
Oribe...

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:39.870
Recall your troops, Nagamasa.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:41.460
Father!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:45.350
I don't approve of Oribe myself,

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:48.020
but I know there are many who respect him.

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:54.220
Many daimyo are not taking any action. We cannot defeat Toyotomi by ourselves.

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:55.460
But...

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:02.110
Give up for now... And only for now...

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:05.570
You bastard, Furuta Oribe!

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:08.160
Why did you accept to be Master's seppuku assistant!?

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:09.250
You're the worst!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.160
We should call up our troops and save Master!

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:17.500
Don't be so hasty. I'm sure Furuori has his own reasons...

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:20.130
Stop right there! You insolent one!

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:26.900
I see you're about to call up your troops?

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:34.790
Give it up. Master does not wish for that, more than anyone else.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.700
What the hell do you know!?

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.680
I know.

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:45.940
I was the last one to receive his teachings in the way of tea.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:49.520
Right before he went under house arrest in Sakai.

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:56.540
His eyes... They seemed quite serious.

00:12:57.700 --> 00:13:01.660
He saw past his present life and over the Sanzu River.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:04.430
This is the stage for his final hurrah!

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:10.200
You want to use cannons and gunpowder to mess it up?

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:11.070
Huh!?

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.070
I cannot believe you.

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:20.620
It can't be helped. I was supposed to keep it a secret.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.810
Master left this with me.

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:38.760
"Please do not involve yourselves in my matters - Rikyū."

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:52.570
Unforgivable... Furuori!

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:05.600
I've stopped them like you said, Oribe.

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:11.060
Now my debt is paid.

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:42.340
Excuse me, but can you make this a one-on-one tea ceremony?

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:45.990
I will perform my duties.

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:11.020
When the assistant was changed to Oribe at the last moment,

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:13.540
I breathed a sigh of relief.

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:14.910
Lord Makita...

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:19.290
I do not wish to have memories of any more seppukus.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:23.150
I will never involve myself in the matters of tea ever again.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.720
There is no more use for that tea bowl.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:16:00.230
From your death poem, I understood your anger in regards to your punishment.

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:06.550
You also refuse to wear the traditional white garb at your last tea ceremony.

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:10.570
You sit topless, with every intention to die for imperfection.

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:13.150
But... In that case...

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:18.190
Why did you lash out?

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:21.900
It is too unsightly to display your fury like that.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:27.650
Those who are not sure of themselves can only think at that level.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:36.200
I bet you intend to take my place as the head tea master. That is why you are here to cut off my head.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:39.550
You were lured by pointless ambition.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.420
I do not wish to respond to that.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:52.770
Seems like you have other reasons as well.

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:58.590
Are you trying to use your inability to answer to show your innocence?

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:04.670
I just can't accept a powerless daimyo like you.

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:08.920
You pretend you are all that.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:14.590
You should have just remained at home.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:30.390
Come on, Hideyoshi's dog.

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:33.530
This spot they picked for me to die is not very interesting.

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:39.160
I'll commit seppuku right now so you can hurry on home and eat.

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:13.370
I see. That's how it is.

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:16.380
Everyone disapproves of this punishment.

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:23.690
Master is trying his best to display all of his fury so that no one will have to feel the guilt.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:29.600
He is doing this for me and the Uesugi clan!

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.310
What a man!

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:40.410
What a tea master!

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:46.240
Even at the bitter end, he still watches out for us!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:58.610
I can't do this...

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:08.540
I'm not in a good position.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.030
This damn wall!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.800
So that's the true you.

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:55.050
Do not ever forget that.

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:19.990
This is nice.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:29.660
It is not an imitation.

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:34.730
It's a room that only you can create, Furuori. I am impressed.

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:55.820
It hurts.

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:58.120
Hurry.
